  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Offshore Energy Exhibition &amp; Conference 2022 &#x2013; Participation CERF delegation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CERF delegations from Colombia, Indonesia, Morocco and Ukraine participated actively in the Energy Executives Training (EET) programme, organised alongside OEEC2022.These experts in the offshore wind and hydrogen sector joined a tailored knowledge and networking programme consisting of masterclass sessions, networking events, matchmaking sessions, trade exhibition participation and company visits.</narrative>
  </description>
